Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: munbyn-itpp130-cups
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, cups
Description: CUPS driver for MUNBYN ITPP130 thermal label printers
 Open source CUPS filter and PPD for the MUNBYN ITPP130 4-inch thermal
 label printer. The filter converts CUPS raster into TSPL, the printer's
 native command language.
